    "The PR description states that \"Qt 6.12 LTS contains many bug fixes and officially supports macOS 26\" (citing Qt release notes).",
    "Commit eaa8d1f5a5 notes that \"Qt 6.12 requires macOS 15 SDK or higher. The minimum supported macOS version stays at 14.0.\""
  ],
